TOKEN tinybird_ingest APPEND
TOKEN tinybird_read READ

DESCRIPTION >
    Best-effort product analytics: signed-in page views and checkout starts,
    plus pre-login auth-flow stages (sign_in_*, device_*, authorize_granted,
    link_*). Server-authenticated user IDs join directly to d1_user (signups)
    and stripe_event (fulfilled payments); user_id is '' before a user exists.
    flow_id is a random browser cookie value or the device_code row id, never
    a code, token or email. client_id is the public pk_ app key. No backfill.

SCHEMA >
    `timestamp` DateTime64(3) `json:$.timestamp`,
    `event_id` String `json:$.event_id`,
    `event` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.event`,
    `user_id` String `json:$.user_id`,
    `environment` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.environment`,
    `page` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.page` DEFAULT '',
    `pack_key` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.pack_key` DEFAULT '',
    `flow_id` String `json:$.flow_id` DEFAULT '',
    `client_id` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.client_id` DEFAULT ''

ENGINE "MergeTree"
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY "environment, timestamp, event, user_id"
ENGINE_PRIMARY_KEY "environment, timestamp"
